    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Biologics (infliximab, adalimumab, certolizumab pegol, vedolizumab, ustekinumab, mirikizumab, risankizumab, guselkumab), with or without an immunomodulator (azathioprine, 6-mercaptopurine, methotrexate), can be first-line for induction and maintenance"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Toxic appearance, high fever, persistent vomiting, rebound, or a tender or palpable mass: hospitalize for IV fluids and antibiotics; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "abscesses must be drained"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": ", percutaneously or surgically"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
